SDL-E1058 (spec/field.md)

  x invalid INLINE field: only a top-level field can be INLINE — a dotted or wildcard path cannot embed into the adjacency payloads
   ,----
 1 | field stats.views: int { on: t; inline; };
   :                                 ^^^|^^
   :                                    `-- this field cannot be INLINE
   `----
  help: `inline;` embeds a field's value into its table's edge-adjacency payloads — it needs a TYPE RELATION host, a top-level non-`in`/`out` name, and a stored (not computed) value
